  "demo": {
    "title": "図形の橋と境界を別々に調整",
    "caption": "初期値は海辺、円A/Bの中心(120,120)/(200,120)、半径60pxずつ、ブレンド幅40px、境界ぼかし12px、暗さの重み65%、候補1200個、シード42です。マスク図で円をドラッグして位置を変えられます。",
    "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:12px;background:#f4f0e7;color:#29383d;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(155px,1fr));gap:8px}label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px}select,input,button{min-height:44px;padding:7px;border:1px solid #c8c1b5;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:inherit;font:inherit}input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:#3d7d83}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.row input{flex:1}.buttons{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.panel{min-width:0}.panel b{font-size:13px}canvas{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:block;border:1px solid #cfc8bb;background:#fff}.move{touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}.note{min-height:1.5em;font-size:13px;color:#52666a}@media(max-width:650px){.views{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:430px){body{padding:8px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<label>元の絵<select id=\"scene\"><option value=\"sea\">海辺</option><option value=\"flower\">花</option><option value=\"city\">街並み</option></select></label>\n<label>合成方法<select id=\"mode\"><option value=\"smooth\">smooth minで合体</option><option value=\"hard\">普通のminで合体</option><option value=\"intersection\">smooth maxで重なり</option><option value=\"difference\">smooth maxでAからBを抜く</option></select></label>\n<label>円Aの半径 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"ra\" type=\"range\" min=\"25\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\"><output id=\"raOut\">60px</output></span></label>\n<label>円Bの半径 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"rb\" type=\"range\" min=\"25\" max=\"100\" value=\"60\"><output id=\"rbOut\">60px</output></span></label>\n<label>距離を混ぜる幅 k <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"blend\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"80\" value=\"40\"><output id=\"blendOut\">40px</output></span></label>\n<label>境界ぼかし幅 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"feather\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"40\" value=\"12\"><output id=\"featherOut\">12px</output></span></label>\n<label>暗さを優先 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"alpha\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"65\"><output id=\"alphaOut\">65%</output></span></label>\n<label>候補の数 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"count\" type=\"range\" min=\"300\" max=\"3600\" step=\"100\" value=\"1200\"><output id=\"countOut\">1200</output></span></label>\n<label>筆跡の長さ <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"length\" type=\"range\" min=\"4\" max=\"28\" value=\"12\"><output id=\"lengthOut\">12px</output></span></label>\n<label>筆跡の太さ <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"thick\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"7\" value=\"2\"><output id=\"thickOut\">2px</output></span></label>\n<label>シード値 <span class=\"row\"><input id=\"seed\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"9999\" value=\"42\"></span></label>\n</div><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"render\">この条件で描く</button><button id=\"newSeed\">シードを変える</button><button id=\"save\">完成画像をPNG保存</button></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\">マスク図の円をドラッグして配置を変えられます。</p>\n<div class=\"views\">\n<div class=\"panel\"><b>1. 元の絵</b><canvas id=\"source\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><b>2. 距離を混ぜた形マスク</b><canvas id=\"gate\" class=\"move\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\" aria-label=\"二つの円のsmooth distance mask。円をドラッグして中心を移動\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><b>3. 最終確率</b><canvas id=\"prob\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><b>4. 採用した筆跡</b><canvas id=\"result\" width=\"360\" height=\"240\"></canvas></div>\n</div><script>\nconst W=360,H=240,byId=id=>document.getElementById(id),canvases=[\"source\",\"gate\",\"prob\",\"result\"].map(byId),ctx=canvases.map(c=>c.getContext(\"2d\"));\nlet ax=120,ay=120,bx=200,by=120,pixels,dragTarget=null;const clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));\nfunction randFactory(seed){let s=seed>>>0;return()=>{s=(s*1664525+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction scene(){const c=ctx[0],g=c.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,H),v=byId(\"scene\").value;\nif(v===\"sea\"){g.addColorStop(0,\"#d6e1df\");g.addColorStop(.48,\"#8eaaa6\");g.addColorStop(.49,\"#435f65\");g.addColorStop(1,\"#d4b98e\")}\nif(v===\"flower\"){g.addColorStop(0,\"#e9d8bd\");g.addColorStop(1,\"#526e4e\")}\nif(v===\"city\"){g.addColorStop(0,\"#bfced1\");g.addColorStop(1,\"#b3a58c\")}\nc.fillStyle=g;c.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\nif(v===\"sea\"){c.fillStyle=\"#65756c\";c.fillRect(32,90,45,52);c.fillRect(80,72,28,70);c.fillStyle=\"#eee0c5\";for(let i=0;i<9;i++)c.fillRect(39+i%3*12,99+Math.floor(i/3)*13,5,6)}\nif(v===\"flower\"){c.fillStyle=\"#d7a35c\";for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const a=i*Math.PI/4;c.beginPath();c.ellipse(180+Math.cos(a)*28,118+Math.sin(a)*28,14,26,a,0,Math.PI*2);c.fill()}c.fillStyle=\"#754d3b\";c.beginPath();c.arc(180,118,15,0,Math.PI*2);c.fill();c.strokeStyle=\"#344f3b\";c.lineWidth=5;c.beginPath();c.moveTo(180,145);c.lineTo(180,225);c.stroke()}\nif(v===\"city\"){c.fillStyle=\"#746c61\";for(let i=0;i<5;i++){let x=25+i*62,h=65+(i%3)*22;c.fillRect(x,H-h,48,h);c.fillStyle=\"#ecd6aa\";for(let y=H-h+10;y<H-8;y+=18)c.fillRect(x+9,y,8,9);c.fillStyle=\"#746c61\"}}\nif(v===\"sea\"||v===\"city\"){c.strokeStyle=v===\"sea\"?\"#edf0df\":\"#596970\";c.lineWidth=2;for(let y=156;y<225;y+=13){c.beginPath();c.moveTo(4,y);c.lineTo(350,y+(y%3)*2);c.stroke()}}\npixels=c.getImageData(0,0,W,H).data;\n}\nfunction sample(x,y){const i=(Math.floor(y)*W+Math.floor(x))*4;return .299*pixels[i]+.587*pixels[i+1]+.114*pixels[i+2]}\nfunction grad(x,y){const gx=(sample(clamp(x+2,0,W-1),y)-sample(clamp(x-2,0,W-1),y))/4,gy=(sample(x,clamp(y+2,0,H-1))-sample(x,clamp(y-2,0,H-1)))/4;return[Math.hypot(gx,gy),Math.atan2(gy,gx)+Math.PI/2]}\nfunction vals(){return{ra:+byId(\"ra\").value,rb:+byId(\"rb\").value,blend:+byId(\"blend\").value,feather:+byId(\"feather\").value,alpha:+byId(\"alpha\").value/100,count:+byId(\"count\").value,len:+byId(\"length\").value,thick:+byId(\"thick\").value,seed:+byId(\"seed\").value||42,mode:byId(\"mode\").value}}\nfunction smoothMin(a,b,k){if(k<=0)return Math.min(a,b);const h=Math.max(k-Math.abs(a-b),0)/k;return Math.min(a,b)-h*h*k*.25}\nfunction smoothMax(a,b,k){return-smoothMin(-a,-b,k)}\nfunction field(x,y,v){const dA=Math.hypot(x-ax,y-ay)-v.ra,dB=Math.hypot(x-bx,y-by)-v.rb;if(v.mode===\"hard\")return Math.min(dA,dB);if(v.mode===\"intersection\")return smoothMax(dA,dB,v.blend);if(v.mode===\"difference\")return smoothMax(dA,-dB,v.blend);return smoothMin(dA,dB,v.blend)}\nfunction maskAt(x,y,v){const d=field(x,y,v);return v.feather===0?(d<=0?1:0):clamp((v.feather-d)/v.feather,0,1)}\nfunction pAt(x,y,v){const pDark=1-sample(x,y)/255,[m]=grad(x,y),strength=Math.min(m/180,1),pFeature=v.alpha*pDark+(1-v.alpha)*strength;return maskAt(x,y,v)*pFeature}\nfunction drawGate(v){const c=ctx[1],im=c.createImageData(W,H);for(let y=0;y<H;y++)for(let x=0;x<W;x++){const m=Math.round(maskAt(x,y,v)*255),i=(y*W+x)*4;im.data[i]=m;im.data[i+1]=m;im.data[i+2]=m;im.data[i+3]=255}c.putImageData(im,0,0);c.lineWidth=2;c.strokeStyle=\"#d05c43\";c.beginPath();c.arc(ax,ay,v.ra,0,Math.PI*2);c.stroke();c.strokeStyle=\"#417786\";c.beginPath();c.arc(bx,by,v.rb,0,Math.PI*2);c.stroke();c.fillStyle=\"#d05c43\";c.beginPath();c.arc(ax,ay,4,0,Math.PI*2);c.fill();c.fillStyle=\"#417786\";c.beginPath();c.arc(bx,by,4,0,Math.PI*2);c.fill()}\nfunction drawProb(v){const c=ctx[2],im=c.createImageData(W,H);for(let y=0;y<H;y++)for(let x=0;x<W;x++){const n=Math.round(pAt(x,y,v)*255),i=(y*W+x)*4;im.data[i]=n;im.data[i+1]=n;im.data[i+2]=n;im.data[i+3]=255}c.putImageData(im,0,0)}\nfunction drawResult(v){const c=ctx[3];c.drawImage(canvases[0],0,0);c.save();c.lineCap=\"round\";const rnd=randFactory(v.seed);let accepted=0;for(let i=0;i<v.count;i++){const x=rnd()*W,y=rnd()*H,p=pAt(x,y,v);if(rnd()<p){const[mag,a]=grad(x,y),len=v.len*(.5+Math.min(mag/90,1));c.strokeStyle=byId(\"scene\").value===\"flower\"?\"#fff0c9\":\"#f8ead0\";c.lineWidth=v.thick*(.7+rnd()*.6);c.beginPath();c.moveTo(x-Math.cos(a)*len/2,y-Math.sin(a)*len/2);c.lineTo(x+Math.cos(a)*len/2,y+Math.sin(a)*len/2);c.stroke();accepted++}}c.restore();byId(\"note\").textContent=\"候補\"+v.count+\"個のうち\"+accepted+\"本を採用。円A・Bをドラッグして配置を変えられます。\"}\nfunction updateLabels(){for(const[id,suf]of[[\"ra\",\"px\"],[\"rb\",\"px\"],[\"blend\",\"px\"],[\"feather\",\"px\"],[\"alpha\",\"%\"],[\"count\",\"\"],[\"length\",\"px\"],[\"thick\",\"px\"]])byId(id+\"Out\").value=byId(id).value+suf}\nfunction render(){updateLabels();scene();const v=vals();drawGate(v);drawProb(v);drawResult(v)}\ncanvases[1].addEventListener(\"pointerdown\",e=>{const r=canvases[1].getBoundingClientRect(),x=(e.clientX-r.left)*W/r.width,y=(e.clientY-r.top)*H/r.height;dragTarget=Math.hypot(x-ax,y-ay)<Math.hypot(x-bx,y-by)?\"A\":\"B\";canvases[1].setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);move(e)});\ncanvases[1].addEventListener(\"pointermove\",e=>{if(dragTarget)move(e)});canvases[1].addEventListener(\"pointerup\",()=>dragTarget=null);canvases[1].addEventListener(\"pointercancel\",()=>dragTarget=null);\nfunction move(e){const r=canvases[1].getBoundingClientRect(),x=clamp((e.clientX-r.left)*W/r.width,0,W),y=clamp((e.clientY-r.top)*H/r.height,0,H);if(dragTarget===\"A\"){ax=x;ay=y}else{bx=x;by=y}const v=vals();drawGate(v);drawProb(v);drawResult(v)}\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"input,select\").forEach(el=>el.addEventListener(\"input\",render));\nbyId(\"render\").addEventListener(\"click\",render);byId(\"newSeed\").addEventListener(\"click\",()=>{byId(\"seed\").value=(+byId(\"seed\").value+137)%9999+1;render()});\nbyId(\"save\").addEventListener(\"click\",()=>{const a=document.createElement(\"a\");a.download=\"smooth-distance-blending.png\";a.href=canvases[3].toDataURL(\"image/png\");a.click()});\nrender();\n</script></body></html>"
  },
  "experiments": [
    {
      "title": "普通のminで境目を見る",
      "action": "合成方法を普通のminにし、二つの円の間に少し隙間ができる位置へドラッグします。",
      "observe": "円の間の点はどちらの距離も正で、マスクが黒くなり、筆跡が途切れる位置を見ます。"
    },
    {
      "title": "橋を広げる",
      "action": "smooth minを選び、ブレンド幅kを0px、20px、40px、80pxと変えます。",
      "observe": "kが大きいほど距離を混ぜる範囲が広がり、二つの円の間に太い橋ができるか比べます。"
    },
    {
      "title": "端のぼかしと分ける",
      "action": "ブレンド幅を固定し、境界ぼかしを0pxから20pxまで動かします。",
      "observe": "円どうしをつなぐ量は変わらず、できあがった形の外周だけが柔らかくなることを見ます。"
    },
    {
      "title": "別の演算でも試す",
      "action": "smooth maxの重なりとAからBを抜く演算を選び、ブレンド幅を動かします。",
      "observe": "外側の輪郭だけでなく、内側のくびれや型抜き部分もなめらかに変わります。"
    },
    {
      "title": "画像特徴を変える",
      "action": "元の絵と暗さの重みを切り替え、同じ形とシードで筆跡を比べます。",
      "observe": "形マスクは同じまま、元絵の明暗・輪郭で候補の通りやすさが変わると確かめます。"
    },
    {
      "title": "自分の塊を作る",
      "action": "二つの円の位置・半径・ブレンド幅を決め、シードを変えて気に入った結果をPNG保存します。",
      "observe": "二つの距離がどの範囲で混ざったか、くびれの見た目を使って説明します。"
    }
  ],
  "artist": {
